diff --git a/docs/api/sections/activities.md b/docs/api/sections/activities.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2f27b05
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/api/sections/activities.md
@@ -0,0 +1,76 @@
+# Activities
+
+Account activity is a reverse-chronological feed of events on boards you can access.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activity events, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator ID(s) |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+Only activity on boards the current user can access is returned. Inaccessible `board_ids[]` are ignored.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohde",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "description": "David assigned JZ to \"Layout is broken\"",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zppzlksuj4mxba2nbzn"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/2",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+      "number": 2,
+      "title": "Layout is broken",
+      "status": "published"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm"
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true,
+      "email_address": "david@example.com",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+`eventable`, `board`, and `creator` use the same representations as the Cards, Boards, and Users endpoints.
+
+For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, `url` opens the card where the comment was posted and jumps to that comment.
+
+`description` is the plain-text form of the event.
+
+The `particulars` object exposes event-specific details:
+
+| Action | Particulars |
+|--------|-------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids` |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| `card_triaged` | `column` |
+| Other actions | `{}` |
+
+Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+Included actions: `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_board_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `card_title_changed`, `comment_created`.
